         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Hands on Yupana\n\nIn the Tawantinsuyu region highlighted on the map, the Incas created a system that represents numerical growth in relation to our hands, and clicking on \"Draw to Count\" will teach you how the Incas represented numbers.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
