         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Draw to Count\n\nOn this screen, we will learn how numbers are represented on the Yupana. Using the arrows below, observe how numbers grow from right to left. Also, observe that the dots on the screen can be compared with the tips of our fingers. Finally, observe that on each Yupana line, it is not possible to represent numbers greater than 9.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
